msgid ""
"[[quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-verify-token]]`link:#quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-verify-token[quarkus.csrf-reactive.verify-token]`\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Verify CSRF token in the CSRF filter. If this property is enabled then the input stream will be read and cached by the CSRF filter to verify the token. If you prefer then you can disable this property and compare CSRF form and cookie parameters in the application code using JAX-RS jakarta.ws.rs.FormParam which refers to the `form-field-name` form property and jakarta.ws.rs.CookieParam which refers to the `CsrfReactiveConfig++#++cookieName` cookie. Note that even if the CSRF token verification in the CSRF filter is disabled, the filter will still perform checks to ensure the token is available, has the correct `token-size` in bytes and that the Content-Type HTTP header is either 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' or 'multipart/form-data'.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_CSRF_REACTIVE_VERIFY_TOKEN+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid "[[quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-verify-token]]`link:#quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-verify-token[quarkus.csrf-reactive.verify-token]`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Verify CSRF token in the CSRF filter. If this property is enabled then the input stream will be read and cached by the CSRF filter to verify the token. If you prefer then you can disable this property and compare CSRF form and cookie parameters in the application code using JAX-RS jakarta.ws.rs.FormParam which refers to the `form-field-name` form property and jakarta.ws.rs.CookieParam which refers to the `CsrfReactiveConfig++#++cookieName` cookie. Note that even if the CSRF token verification in the CSRF filter is disabled, the filter will still perform checks to ensure the token is available, has the correct `token-size` in bytes and that the Content-Type HTTP header is either 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' or 'multipart/form-data'."
msgstr ""

msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_CSRF_REACTIVE_VERIFY_TOKEN+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"[[quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-require-form-url-encoded]]`link:#quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-require-form-url-encoded[quarkus.csrf-reactive.require-form-url-encoded]`\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Require that only 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' or 'multipart/form-data' body is accepted for the token verification to proceed. Disable this property for the CSRF filter to avoid verifying the token for POST requests with other content types. This property is only effective if `verify-token` property is enabled.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_CSRF_REACTIVE_REQUIRE_FORM_URL_ENCODED+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid "[[quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-require-form-url-encoded]]`link:#quarkus-csrf-reactive_quarkus-csrf-reactive-require-form-url-encoded[quarkus.csrf-reactive.require-form-url-encoded]`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Require that only 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' or 'multipart/form-data' body is accepted for the token verification to proceed. Disable this property for the CSRF filter to avoid verifying the token for POST requests with other content types. This property is only effective if `verify-token` property is enabled."
msgstr ""

msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_CSRF_REACTIVE_REQUIRE_FORM_URL_ENCODED+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid "About the Duration format"
msgstr "期間フォーマットについて"

msgid ""
"To write duration values, use the standard `java.time.Duration` format.\n"
"See the link:https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/11/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html#parse(java.lang.CharSequence)[Duration#parse() javadoc] for more information."
msgstr ""
"期間の値を書くには、標準の `java.time.Duration` フォーマットを使います。\n"
"詳細は link:https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/11/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html#parse(java.lang.CharSequence)[Duration#parse() javadoc] を参照してください。"

msgid "You can also use a simplified format, starting with a number:"
msgstr "数字で始まる簡略化した書式を使うこともできます:"

msgid "If the value is only a number, it represents time in seconds."
msgstr "数値のみの場合は、秒単位の時間を表します。"

msgid "If the value is a number followed by `ms`, it represents time in milliseconds."
msgstr "数値の後に `ms` が続く場合は、ミリ秒単位の時間を表します。"

msgid "In other cases, the simplified format is translated to the `java.time.Duration` format for parsing:"
msgstr "その他の場合は、簡略化されたフォーマットが解析のために `java.time.Duration` フォーマットに変換されます："

msgid "If the value is a number followed by `h`, `m`, or `s`, it is prefixed with `PT`."
msgstr "数値の後に `h` 、 `m` 、 `s` が続く場合は、その前に `PT` が付けられます。"

msgid "If the value is a number followed by `d`, it is prefixed with `P`."
msgstr "数値の後に `d` が続く場合は、その前に `P` が付けられます。"

